    "title": "Notice of change of venue: Halifax County Board of Commissioners, Monday, Oct. 19, 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lance Martin ,\n1 days ago NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN in accordance with the North Carolina General Statute §143-318.12 that the Monday, October 19, 2026 Regular Meeting of the Halifax County Board of Commissioners scheduled to begin at 5:30 P. M. in the Halifax County Historic Courthouse meeting venue has changed to the Enfield/Inborden STEAM Academy, 13723 NC 481, Enfield, North Carolina. Read full article",
